### 1. 查询所有学生
GET http://localhost:8081/students

### 2. 按 ID 查询学生
GET http://localhost:8081/students/1

### 3. 新增学生
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "赵六",
  "age": 28
}

### 4. 修改学生
PUT http://localhost:8081/students/1
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张三",
  "age": 26
}

### 5. 删除学生
DELETE http://localhost:8081/students/5

### 6. 参数校验失败（年龄超出范围）
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "测试",
  "age": 200
}

### 7. 业务异常（姓名重复）
POST http://localhost:8081/students
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "张三",
  "age": 30
}

### 8. 查询不存在的学生
GET http://localhost:8081/students/999

### 9. 事务测试（新增+日志）
POST http://localhost:8081/students/with-log
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "事务测试",
  "age": 22
}